# Water Vapor Palette for Brightness Temperature (°C)
# Range: -90°C (cold, moist) to 50°C (warm, dry)
-90  255  255  255   -80  255  255  200
-80  255  255  200   -60  200  200  100
-60  200  200  100   -40  150  150  50
-40  150  150  50    -20  255  165  0
-20  255  165  0      0   128  128  128
 0  128  128  128    20   64   64   64
20   64   64   64    50    0    0    0